F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 on the middle, June to July ran 213% of normal and November to December ran 34%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 30% of normal on the middle. Grid 25929 had its driest year in 2012, at 54% of normal.</p>"}
